{"id":"2106097665","type":"page","ari":"ari:cloud:confluence:97c827fd-41ee-460c-8f51-353e72947a5e:page/2106097665","base64EncodedAri":"YXJpOmNsb3VkOmNvbmZsdWVuY2U6OTdjODI3ZmQtNDFlZS00NjBjLThmNTEtMzUzZTcyOTQ3YTVlOmNvbnRlbnQvMjEwNjA5NzY2NQ==","status":"current","title":"List of Cruise Participants (API)","version":{"by":{"type":"known","accountId":"6017c5ee8fb6ea014aa8457a","accountType":"atlassian","email":"","publicName":"Rienk Douma (Unlicensed)","profilePicture":{"path":"/wiki/aa-avatar/6017c5ee8fb6ea014aa8457a","width":48,"height":48,"isDefault":false},"displayName":"Rienk Douma (Unlicensed)","isExternalCollaborator":false,"isGuest":false,"locale":"en_GB","accountStatus":"active","_expandable":{"operations":"","personalSpace":""},"_links":{"self":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/user?accountId=6017c5ee8fb6ea014aa8457a"}},"when":"2024-03-04T16:03:51.125Z","friendlyWhen":"Mar 04, 2024","message":"","number":3,"minorEdit":false,"ncsStepVersion":"2","ncsStepVersionSource":"ncs-ack","confRev":"confluence$content$2106097665.52","contentTypeModified":false,"_expandable":{"collaborators":"","content":"/rest/api/content/2106097665"},"_links":{"self":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/2106097665/version/3"}},"macroRenderedOutput":{},"body":{"storage":{"value":"<h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Authentication</span></h2><p>The API requires you to provide an API key in your requests to get responses. The key should be included in the header of your request:</p><p><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;--header 'x-api-key: &lt;your_api_key_here&gt; '&nbsp;</em></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">HTTP Request Format</span></h2><p>https://{mfp.url}/api/v1/programme/cruise/{id}/cruiseparticipants</p><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"50710291-cad9-4668-a3a3-7ea861359b0b\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 118.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 640.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Parameter</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Description</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>mfp.url</p></td><td><p>The MFP url for your organisation</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>id</p></td><td><p>The identification number of the cruise</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Errors</span></h2><p>MFP APIs follow the HTTP response status codes, which indicate whether a specific HTTP request has been successfully completed. Below a summary of the most common codes you'll find in our responses:</p><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"718606d5-6b83-455a-8f19-b731c8fc8895\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 148.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 610.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Code</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Description</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>200</p></td><td><p>OK. Everything worked as expected.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>400</p></td><td><p>Bad Request. The request was unacceptable, often due to missing a required parameter.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>401</p></td><td><p>Unauthorized. No valid API key provided.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>403</p></td><td><p>Forbidden. The API key doesn't have permissions to perform the request.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>404</p></td><td><p>Not Found. The requested resource doesn't exist.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>429</p></td><td><p>Too Many Requests. Too many requests hit the API too quickly. We recommend an exponential backoff of your requests.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>500, 502, 503, 504</p></td><td><p>Server Errors. Something went wrong on MFP end.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Response</span></h2><p><em>OK</em></p><p>Response schema type: object</p><p /><h4><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Typical output HTTP request</span></h4><p>{<br />    &quot;Firstname&quot;: null,<br />    &quot;Surname&quot;: null,<br />    &quot;Role&quot;: &quot;Chief Scientist&quot;,<br />    &quot;EmailAddress&quot;: null<br />},</p><h4><span style=\"color: rgb(151,160,175);\">Output variables</span></h4><table data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"97c0dddd-f5fd-4f62-a1ae-6787900c721c\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 145.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 613.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p><strong>Variable</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Description</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Firstname</p></td><td><p>The first name of the participant</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Surname</p></td><td><p>The last name of the participant</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Role</p></td><td><p>The role of the participant</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>EmailAddress</p></td><td><p>The email address of the participant</p></td></tr></tbody></table>","representation":"storage","embeddedContent":[],"_expandable":{"content":"/rest/api/content/2106097665"}},"_expandable":{"editor":"","atlas_doc_format":"","view":"","export_view":"","styled_view":"","markdown":"","dynamic":"","editor2":"","anonymous_export_view":""}},"extensions":{"position":483644058},"_expandable":{"container":"/rest/api/space/API","metadata":"","restrictions":"/rest/api/content/2106097665/restriction/byOperation","history":"/rest/api/content/2106097665/history","descendants":"/rest/api/content/2106097665/descendant","space":"/rest/api/space/API","childTypes":"","schedulePublishInfo":"","operations":"","schedulePublishDate":"","children":"/rest/api/content/2106097665/child","ancestors":"","draftVersion":""},"_links":{"editui":"/pages/resumedraft.action?draftId=2106097665","webui":"/spaces/API/pages/2106097665/List+of+Cruise+Participants+API","edituiv2":"/spaces/API/pages/edit-v2/2106097665","context":"/wiki","self":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/2106097665","tinyui":"/x/AYCIfQ","collection":"/rest/api/content","base":"https://maas-se.atlassian.net/wiki"}}